    "sections": {
        "description": "Retainer is a block theme for accountants, financial advisers, consultants and other small professional practices, set like a well-kept engagement letter. The home page opens with the letter laid on a desk: a letterhead, a \"Re:\" subject line and a booking button on the signature line, with fees, response time and registration at a glance beside it. Patterns answer what clients ask before they get in touch: what you do, what it costs (fixed fee, retainer or hourly, with a full schedule of fees), how an engagement runs, who will look after them, and which registrations, memberships and insurance you hold. An Important information notice handles advice warnings and complaints details. Most sections come in more than one layout, with three starter pages, three letterheads, four style variations, extra colour palettes and two type pairings. Articles get a calm reading layout. Retainer looks finished with text alone, loads nothing from external servers and bundles Literata and Atkinson Hyperlegible Next, a typeface designed for low-vision readers."
    },
